{"Stream-related methods (SubscribeStream, RunStream) in ContextualLoggerMiddleware are not instrumented with contextual logging unlike other methods, causing missing critical contextual information (pluginId, dsUID, etc.) in logs for streaming operations": 0.806911289691925, "TestLogger.FromContext method returns a new TestLogger instance via NewTestLogger() instead of returning the receiver (f), causing logs to be recorded on an un-referenced instance and breaking test assertions": 0.9565750360488892, "Refactoring of logRequest removes pluginCtx parameter which eliminates critical contextual information (pluginId, dsName, dsUID, uname) from plugin request logs since calling functions don't enrich the context before calling logRequest": 0.6105904579162598}